---
TDL: 0.1
Name: NavigationDrawer
Tesserae: "0.6"
---
# The look of the standard navigation drawer: a `surface` column.
Styles {
  Rule {
    Widget: NavigationDrawer
    Style {
      Background: <| 'surface@72%' if frosted else 'surface' |>
      Backdrop_Blur: <| 20 if frosted else 0 |>
    }
  }
}
